      {
        "name": "Async/Await Pattern",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "All async operations use async/await consistently. Entry point uses top-level async main() function."
      },
      {
        "name": "Pagination with for-await-of",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "Uses for-await-of over listBlobsFlat() (good), but collects ALL blobs into an array via blobs.push(blob) before returning — violates the 'does not collect all pages into an array in memory' requirement."
      },
      {
        "name": "LRO Pattern (beginXxx + pollUntilDone)",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Not applicable for this scenario — blob upload/download/list/delete are not long-running operations. No LRO misuse detected."
      },
      {
        "name": "RestError Exception Handling",
